{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/c864fff507cd10898c028c505c3facae.avif?t=1745552277\" width=600 height=192 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Purrseus</strong>, hero of ancient Greece, tasked by the Gods to <strong>prove your wisdom and might</strong> by overcoming a series of <strong>challenging trials</strong>. You'll contend with <strong>puzzles, traps, monsters</strong>, and all manner of environmental danger on your <strong>epic journey</strong>. But fear not! At your disposal will be many <strong>amazing and magical items</strong>. Some trials may require you to <strong>enlist the aid of Fursephone,</strong> Purrseus' sister and fellow hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROVE YOUR WORTH, HEROES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/dcee504457394132ba3ba38d96a23649.poster.avif?t=1745552277\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/dcee504457394132ba3ba38d96a23649.webm?t=1745552277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/dcee504457394132ba3ba38d96a23649.mp4?t=1745552277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One or two heroes</strong> can take on the many puzzling and challenging trials. Choose your actions wisely, heroes, and use teamwork when necessary! Solve each level's mysteries, <strong>collect the gems, get to the exit</strong>, ready to take on the next challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AVOID MONSTERS AND DEADLY TRAPS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/38391d5dbec4a3a88a1d9435cbfaafa3.poster.avif?t=1745552277\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/38391d5dbec4a3a88a1d9435cbfaafa3.webm?t=1745552277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/38391d5dbec4a3a88a1d9435cbfaafa3.mp4?t=1745552277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many dangers await you! <strong>Vile and deadly monsters</strong> such as the Gorgon, Cyclops, Minotaur, and more will stand between you and success. <strong>Fire, Ice, and Lightning traps</strong> will require special strategy and care to avoid!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>USE MAGICAL ITEMS TO AID IN YOUR ADVENTURE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/dba9057329663d1a51f1e5eaf76e1bf9.poster.avif?t=1745552277\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/dba9057329663d1a51f1e5eaf76e1bf9.webm?t=1745552277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/extras/dba9057329663d1a51f1e5eaf76e1bf9.mp4?t=1745552277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The many levels are loaded with <strong>helpful items</strong> such as the amulet of strength, the ice bow, firepots, the teleporter staff, the reverser wand, keys, the portal bident, and more! <strong>Use them wisely,</strong> for they may spell the difference between success and failure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single and MultiCat modes for <strong>one or two players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local\u00a0<strong>Coop</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player mode allows for play on 2-player levels via <strong>switching of heroes with one controller</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High scores</strong> tracked for time, moves, and efficiency in all game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bronze/Silver/Gold Medals</strong> for each score category and game mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original <strong>soundtrack</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens</strong> of devious levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to challenge <strong>all skill levels</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1334960?t=1745552277","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/c2d2a813483bb8a175ce1339488e3b8b7ad3f40f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745552277","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/ad6804fae69844340e39ec77cbf7efd3e1f5fb8e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745552277","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/ad6804fae69844340e39ec77cbf7efd3e1f5fb8e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745552277","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full",