ailure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single and MultiCat modes for <strong>one or two players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local\u00a0<strong>Coop</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player mode allows for play on 2-player levels via <strong>switching of heroes with one controller</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High scores</strong> tracked for time, moves, and efficiency in all game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bronze/Silver/Gold Medals</strong> for each score category and game mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original <strong>soundtrack</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens</strong> of devious levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to challenge <strong>all skill levels</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["Joshua Esch","John Norvell"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334960/acba49b6dccdb3c78a5d7223316b7014063d9d51/header.jpg?t=1745552277","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1334960/871672/f5389e267296730e1de885291372b0d759145cd6/1751223015/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745340245","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1334960/871672/f5389e267296730e1de885291372b0d759145cd6/1751223015/dash_h264.mpd?t=1745340245","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/133496